munity_assets/images/apps/534380/fc7824e3a653beca7155881ecb2facc2716c0baa.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":76.4000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_28","strName":"噢，原来是这样啊！","strDescription":"第一次模改你的武器。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/29b5071f78b68a339612ececf3fbc9f883f1b3aa.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":66.9000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_25","strName":"燃烧旗帜","strDescription":"清理第一个土匪营地。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/369322e468a473dfaafb31909e302eef4c7c5a44.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":64.80000305175781,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_4","strName":"高压之下","strDescription":"启动第一座水塔。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/621a028235ba58c86ddc7b6adf9c6bd073f5f6eb.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":63.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_44","strName":"社交达人","strDescription":"加入一场合作游戏。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/cf708a67730b98017816a01e47260ea8cba9af7a.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":60.20000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_6","strName":"黑暗中的光芒","strDescription":"启动第一座变电站。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/b419aaa58c1eb5fa81ab7169bfcfa5e9bb245cdb.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":58,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_39","strName":"夜之猎手","strDescription":"击杀一头夜魔。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/534380/8a48178706726000a30a7fa0d5ed098e4eda84fe.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":56.900001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":65,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Techland","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/Techland"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Techland","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/Techland"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Dying Light","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/35023672"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p]关于这款游戏[/p][p]《消逝的光芒2：坚守人性》重装上阵版包含：[/p][p]《消逝的光芒2：坚守人性》[/p][p]《消逝的光芒2：坚守人性》猩红纽带DLC[/p][p][/p][p]距离第一部游戏的故事已经过去了20年，病毒占了上风，人类正逐渐走向灭亡。你将扮演艾登·克拉德威尔，一个流浪漫游者，负责运送货物和传递消息，在被丧尸病毒摧毁的荒芜世界中，保持着与仅存的几个生存者聚居点的联系。然而，你的真正目标是找到妹妹米娅。为了逃离华尔兹医生的痛苦实验，你曾经离开了还是孩童的她。这段过去一直在你心中挥之不去。当你听说米娅可能还活着，并且居住在地球上最后一座城市维勒多时，你终于下定决心直面这一切。 \r\n[/p][p][/p][p]不久后，你发现自己身处一个冲突不断的定居点。你需要参与新奇而残酷的战斗，不断磨砺自己的技能，击败成群的丧尸，并与其他人结盟。你将在城市中漫游，在维勒多的建筑和屋顶上自由奔跑，搜寻偏远地区的战利品，并在夜晚时保持警惕。每当太阳西沉，怪物就会占领所有街道。[/p][p]\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/977370430e9d481d3329d1968fa076bd.poster.avif?t=1766047996\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/977370430e9d481d3329d1968fa076bd.webm?t=1766047996\" webp=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/977370430e9d481d3329d1968fa076bd.webp?t=1766047996\" width=\"800\" height=\"433\"][/imgvid][/p][p]\r\n[/p][p]15年前，人类经历了一场大陷落，这场灾难永远改变了世界。哈兰病毒迅速在全球蔓延，人们很快发现，所有的希望都破灭了。到了2036年，只有为数不多的聚居地存留于世，而人类正在逐渐走向死亡，为无情的新物种——成群结队的丧尸——让路。[/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/5b17182cf99de741cbb8a8986da56405.poster.avif?t=1766047996\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/5b17182cf99de741cbb8a8986da56405.webm?t=1766047996\" webp=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/5b17182cf99de741cbb8a8986da56405.webp?t=1766047996\" width=\"800\" height=\"410\"][/imgvid][/p][p]欢迎来到维勒多，人类最后的堡垒之一。白天，生存者仍然努力在这里生活，寻求一种虚假的正常感。他们建立关系，追逐梦想，让生活继续。表面上看，一切似乎……不错。然而，当日落时分到来，最后一束阳光消失，城市中更可怕的居民将从他们阴暗的巢穴中爬出，占领街道。如果你在黑暗中停留太久，不提高警觉，就可能永远无法回家。[/p][p][/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/aa517cf56f4690612bcb9fc6fe5ebc3e.poster.avif?t=1766047996\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/aa517cf56f4690612bcb9fc6fe5ebc3e.webm?t=1766047996\" webp=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/aa517cf56f4690612bcb9fc6fe5ebc3e.webp?t=1766047996\" width=\"800\" height=\"411\"][/imgvid][/p][p]你不可能赢得所有的战斗。有时候，逃跑才是上策。幸运的是，你正好有这样的技巧。当你陷入危机，跑酷让你顺利逃脱。从一个屋顶跳到另一个屋顶，飞荡着穿过不同的城市景观，利用滑索等等。无论你做什么，当你在维勒多的建筑和屋顶上自由奔跑，寻找战利品或逃离夜晚的危险时，都会体验到独一无二的自由感。[/p][p][/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/369862e7b6daca9653bcf9618cc409a3.poster.avif?t=1766047996\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/369862e7b6daca9653bcf9618cc409a3.webm?t=1766047996\" webp=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/369862e7b6daca9653bcf9618cc409a3.webp?t=1766047996\" width=\"800\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid][/p][p]在这个危险的世界中，只有最强者才能生存。无论你是喜欢粉碎、切割还是肢解挡在你面前的敌人，你都必须发挥创造力才能度过难关。而且，谁说你需要武器？利用你的各种跑酷动作来先发制人。学习战斗和跑酷的方式，在挥舞武器或使用招式抵御任何形式的危险时，感受头骨碎裂和血肉横飞的刺激。还有别忘了，维勒多拥有的武器能让末日后世界最先进的武器库都相形见绌。[/p][p][/p][p]\r\n[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/8377a260a7b540dc27c1a1e15df23bdd.poster.avif?t=1766047996\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/8377a260a7b540dc27c1a1e15df23bdd.webm?t=1766047996\" webp=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534380/extras/8377a260a7b540dc27c1a1e15df23bdd.webp?t=1766047996\" width=\"800\" height=\"426\"][/imgvid][/p][p]有朋友相助，在维勒多活下去会更容易。与最多3名玩家组队，以增加你的生存几率。一起探索剧情，接受漫游者哨站的挑战，或是在城市街道上大肆破坏。[/p]","strSnippet":"人类正在与病毒进行一场注定失败的斗争。在这个末日后丧尸横行的开放世界中，你的跑酷和战斗技能将成为生存的关键。白天，你可以自由穿梭于城市之间，但夜幕降临后，怪物将接管城市的控制权。"}}]]